    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i'll check my saw. i've also been using a very sharp chisel, but the grain in this specific batch of walnut feels different, almost like it's fighting me when i'm paring the ends. do you think it could be a moisture issue or something with the grain direction itself?",
