      "content": "yeah, i'm seeing some of those push angles when i'm trying to pare the pins. the grain just seems to change unexpectedly halfway through a cut too. it's like the wood is behaving inconsistently even though i've checked it for moisture. any other tips for managing those tricky sections of grain?",
